    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY TOOLS AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹常見的金融科技應用工具，並介紹相關的運用案例。課程內容包括： 1.視覺化分析工具與應用、2.人工智慧分析工具、3.雲端工具應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduce usual financial technology tools and the corresponding applications, including visual Analytics tools, artificial intelligent tools and cloud computing tools.",
